# Licensing map

Seeded from nerves_system_rock_4d v0.2.4 (https://github.com/bbangert/nerves_system_rock_4d),
itself a Nerves system for an RK3576 board; the build scaffolding, fwup
configs and scripts derive from it.

This repository combines content under several licenses. The full license
texts are in LICENSES/.

| Content | License |
| --- | --- |
| Build configuration, fwup configs, scripts, docs (this project's own files) | GPL-2.0-or-later |
| `linux/*.patch` (Linux kernel device-tree patches) | GPL-2.0-only (kernel license) |
| `uboot/rkbin/*.bin`, `uboot/rkbin/*.elf` (committed binaries: RK3566 DDR init, BL31; consumed by U-Boot's binman) | Rockchip proprietary (rockchip-linux/rkbin, `uboot/rkbin/LICENSE` = LICENSES/LICENSE.rockchip-rkbin) |

Downloaded at build time (not in this repository): the Linux kernel
(GPL-2.0-only), U-Boot (GPL-2.0-or-later), Buildroot packages (various).
